  "bio": "Felipe Ferreiras is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in intricate black and gray designs in Santo André, Brazil. Renowned for their precise pointillism and elegant minimalistic tattoos, Felipe masterfully brings each client’s vision to life with a keen eye for detail and a deft hand. Whether you're looking for a timeless black and gray piece or an expressive watercolor-inspired tattoo, Felipe's proficiency and artistic versatility promise a truly personalized ink experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Santo André, Sao Paulo, Brazil\n\n》Preto e branco/ Aquarela/ Minimalista/ Pontilhismo.\n  》Para orçamentos e agendamentos direct.",
